WEBVTT

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:11.240
Second Lt. Chuck, remember that activating the scissors results in a loss of power.

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:13.010
Aye, sir.

00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:16.930
Second Lt. Mirage, you're neglecting your right side.

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:19.850
You'd be dead if not for Captain Arad covering you.

00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:20.870
Yes, sir.

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:25.920
That is all. Dismissed.

00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:28.420
Hold on just a minute!

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.920
What's the point in calling me over here?

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:34.130
Why waste my time? You're not even worth talking to.

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:38.350
But since you asked, let me tell you something.

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.810
Don't hesitate in battle. If you get the chance, take the enemy down.

00:00:43.030 --> 00:00:46.810
In the past three encounters, 
you've only aimed for the wings.

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:49.670
The same goes for you, Second Lt. Mirage.

00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:56.400
The Aerial Knights are one thing, but the Spacy pilots were merely under mind control.

00:00:56.400 --> 00:01:00.550
The captain and Chuck also aim for the wings when fighting Spacy.

00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:03.250
That's because they have the necessary skills to do that.

00:01:03.640 --> 00:01:06.520
But you two do not.

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:09.370
Keep this up and yyou are going to die.

00:01:09.370 --> 00:01:12.510
Sir, can you elaborate further on my mistakes?

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:16.280
Your controls are precise.

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:19.100
Any mistakes I could point out would be nitpicking.

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:20.230
Then again...

00:01:20.230 --> 00:01:22.310
That is also your weakness.

00:01:23.290 --> 00:01:25.780
You fly by the book.

00:01:25.780 --> 00:01:28.060
Meaning your motions are obvious.

00:01:28.710 --> 00:01:32.890
Against seasoned pilots, you wouldn't last a minute.

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:40.580
Sgt. Hayate might be lacking in multiple aspects, but his movement is often unpredictable.

00:01:40.580 --> 00:01:45.750
As ludicrous as the Immelmann dance may be, it does demonstrate a good sense of piloting.

00:01:46.350 --> 00:01:48.880
Not that it would keep you alive for long.

00:01:51.270 --> 00:01:54.330
The Grim Reaper be reapin'.

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:56.220
Don't let it get to you, Mirage.

00:01:59.330 --> 00:02:02.050
<i>We've only got one shot at love,</i>

00:02:02.050 --> 00:02:04.910
<i>so let's have fun inside of you</i>

00:02:04.910 --> 00:02:08.770
<i>Let's share a selfish kiss</i>

00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:19.570
<i>The petals of this flower fall in the wind</i>

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:25.040
<i>The stars are more than I could count</i>

00:02:25.040 --> 00:02:28.580
<i>It doesn't matter if I blame it all on you,</i>

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:31.330
<i>swallowing back my tears</i>

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:36.170
<i>I can't tell anyone about how my heart races</i>

00:02:36.170 --> 00:02:38.380
<i>Reach out</i>

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:39.720
<i>Until it all breaks apart</i>

00:02:38.890 --> 00:02:41.630
<i>Reach out</i>

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:42.860
<i>Until you can take flight</i>

00:02:41.800 --> 00:02:44.350
<i>To the ends</i>

00:02:42.920 --> 00:02:45.180
<i>Deep in my heart</i>

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:46.970
<i>Of time</i>

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:47.770
<i>There is a prayer</i>

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:50.690
<i>Just feel, just believe</i>

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:54.790
<i>and speed through it all</i>

00:02:55.190 --> 00:02:57.940
<i>We've only got one shot at love,</i>

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:00.700
<i>so let's have fun inside of you</i>

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:06.280
<i>Let's share a kiss faster than light, just wait for me</i>

00:03:06.280 --> 00:03:08.910
<i>My body almost forgot</i>

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:11.920
<i>My heart kept beating loudly</i>

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:17.350
<i>Escape your chains, they're all but a dream</i>

00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:24.060
<i>Tear them off and come at me, just like that</i>

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:35.150
Planets Listania, Airberl, and now Anthem III.

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:38.990
Windermere has already 
annexed a total of three planets.

00:03:39.210 --> 00:03:41.420
They've won all their battles so far.

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:44.990
Please. Turning the tide around 
is where the game gets fun.

00:03:45.350 --> 00:03:50.200
Captain Arad, can we expect any 
reinforcements from central Spacy?

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:55.580
I wouldn't bet on it. They probably think this is some minor conflict between frontier planets.

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:58.880
Not to mention they have their own stuff to worry about.

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:00.900
Politics is tough.

00:04:01.780 --> 00:04:05.190
Uh... Where is it...

00:04:05.190 --> 00:04:06.820
There you are!

00:04:09.890 --> 00:04:11.450
Oh, shut up!

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:12.890
Ah, I'm gonna be late!

00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:19.190
A rainbow voice?

00:04:19.800 --> 00:04:21.220
Mikumo?

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:37.210
That's the song the Wind Singer sang.

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:39.300
I can't get it out of my head.

00:04:39.860 --> 00:04:44.740
Doesn't it intrigue you how you can feel life shining out of his voice?

00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:47.670
It's strange, isn't it?

00:04:47.670 --> 00:04:50.060
There's nothing like that in your voice.

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:57.080
Welcome!

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:58.360
One jellyfish ramen, coming right up!

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:00.810
Hey, where's our Ragna fried rice?

00:05:00.810 --> 00:05:01.980
Could we order now?

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:04.040
Just a moment!

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:05.450
Welcome!

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.780
Yo, we've got more customers up front!

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:11.090
This place really is busy.

00:05:11.090 --> 00:05:13.530
I saw a ton of people out and about in town, too.

00:05:13.530 --> 00:05:15.620
Nothing boosts the economy like a war or two.

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:18.420
Now that you mention it, I've been seeing a lot of businessmen these days.

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:21.840
War profiteering feels so wrong.

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:25.030
We're not the ones to talk, though.

00:05:28.450 --> 00:05:31.530
Dude, fuck Messer.

00:05:31.530 --> 00:05:34.020
Before, he wouldn't even scold us.

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:37.480
When we screwed up, he'd just give you that look of his.

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:39.360
Sends shivers down my spine.

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:41.230
Yeah, it does...

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:45.320
He told me that I was good for 
nothing with that face of his...

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:48.280
Poor thing.

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:49.970
Word.

00:05:49.970 --> 00:05:51.370
Where's Mira-Mira?

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:53.760
She stayed behind to practice.

00:05:53.760 --> 00:05:56.920
No surprise, given the way she got told off.

00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:02.540
Jeez, Mikumo can be a real slave driver, too.

00:06:02.540 --> 00:06:07.630
But she looks so cool on stage, with her long hair floating behind her.

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:11.680
The way Messer flies is also impressive.

00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:15.660
A lone dart piercing the blue sky.

00:06:15.660 --> 00:06:18.060
A straight, sharp line.

00:06:18.220 --> 00:06:21.430
He's not called the Grim Reaper for nothing.

00:06:21.430 --> 00:06:24.360
Judging by pure mechanics, he may even have the captain beat.

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:26.860
He's good to his Siegfried, too.

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:27.880
Huh?

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:30.350
Haya-Haya's such a mess.

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:36.130
You sortie once, and she comes back more trashed than a girl after an all-nighter.

00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:37.870
A complete wreck.

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:42.830
But Mesamesa's Sieggy is like a girl who's had her beauty sleep.

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:44.860
Skin as beautiful as a newborn!

00:06:44.860 --> 00:06:47.470
Silky smooth and super soft.

00:06:47.470 --> 00:06:48.810
Uh-huh...

00:06:48.810 --> 00:06:50.960
His piloting puts minimal stress on the machine.

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:51.930
Oh?

00:06:53.960 --> 00:06:55.500
You're right.

00:06:59.940 --> 00:07:03.920
The way he flies gets to me.

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:08.760
I know. I end up looking at her 
even if I'm dancing next to her.

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:12.460
It's driving me crazy, but you know...

00:07:12.460 --> 00:07:14.530
Yeah. I'm not gonna lose!

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:16.090
Tomorrow's training...

00:07:16.090 --> 00:07:18.080
I'll show her!

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:20.030
Wow.

00:07:20.030 --> 00:07:21.750
Were they separated at birth?

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:28.010
I heard you're giving them the Spartan treatment.

00:07:28.010 --> 00:07:30.460
It's because I want them to stay alive.

00:07:31.360 --> 00:07:33.510
Just don't break them in the process.

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:36.220
What about you?

00:07:36.440 --> 00:07:38.480
Are you feeling all right?

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:40.620
No problems at all.

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:41.940
Good to hear.

00:07:41.940 --> 00:07:44.240
Remember to take it easy sometimes.

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:45.770
I know.

00:07:46.530 --> 00:07:47.610
Captain Arad!

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:51.880
Look what I've got.

00:07:51.880 --> 00:07:54.490
Oh! Barrette jellycatfish!

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:56.300
Wanna try some at the cafeteria?

00:07:56.300 --> 00:07:58.170
Sounds great!

00:07:58.170 --> 00:07:59.450
You too, Messer.

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:02.380
I need to prepare for tomorrow.

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:04.170
I... see.

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:06.410
Next time, then!

00:08:06.410 --> 00:08:07.640
See you!

00:08:07.640 --> 00:08:11.130
It's jellycatfish! That's the best kind!

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:15.230
Sorry he's always so unsociable.

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:17.840
It's fine. Shall we, then?

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:23.060
Planet Airberl     Ruins of Rig Stania

00:08:40.560 --> 00:08:43.050
Resonance ratio is falling.

00:08:46.180 --> 00:08:47.420
Your Highness!

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:58.480
Your Highness, you should 
refrain from singing for a while.

00:08:58.480 --> 00:09:00.220
We can't afford that.

00:09:00.580 --> 00:09:02.000
Keith?

00:09:02.000 --> 00:09:03.680
Is that combat gear?

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:07.610
Enemy scouts have been spotted near the Starwind sector,

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:08.770
so we disposed of them.

00:09:08.770 --> 00:09:11.340
Why did I get no reports of this?

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:17.410
Your Highness. We cannot secure the Starwind sector without your voice.

00:09:17.410 --> 00:09:21.200
Please grant us the wind that carries our wings.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:22.610
But...

00:09:22.610 --> 00:09:23.870
It's fine.

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:26.790
It is my duty.

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:32.760
In exchange, I want you to end 
this war as swiftly as possible.

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:37.780
I swear upon the scars etched into our planet.

00:09:43.010 --> 00:09:47.000
She's the granddaughter of that genius Jenius pilot!

00:09:47.000 --> 00:09:52.190
If she had but a fragment of her grandparents' talent, but alas...

00:09:53.250 --> 00:09:54.900
Mirage!

00:09:54.900 --> 00:09:58.500
Let's show the Grim Reaper today that our prospects aren't so grim!

00:09:58.500 --> 00:09:59.240
Here.

00:10:02.550 --> 00:10:04.870
Yeah, you're right.

00:10:12.570 --> 00:10:15.460
In orbit around Planet Ionideth

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:24.360
We lost contact with squadron 78 as well!

00:10:24.360 --> 00:10:26.770
They must've fallen under mind contro—

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:30.150
Why do we have to fight our own comrades?!

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:34.780
That's... The Aerial Knights?!

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:40.820
Var outbreak on planet Ionideth.

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:43.530
Install tertiary equipment!

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:46.360
AIR booted.

00:10:48.210 --> 00:10:50.580
Launch system operational.

00:10:52.060 --> 00:10:53.970
You're good to go!

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:54.960
She feels fresh!

00:10:57.920 --> 00:11:00.150
Protection units attached.

00:11:00.150 --> 00:11:02.710
MMP booster packs installed.

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:07.540
Almost 70% of the Spacy pilots have already fallen under mind control

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:09.350
and we also have a guest 
appearance by the Aerial Knights.

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:12.780
The Alpha and Beta Platoons are to defend point Charlie.

00:11:12.780 --> 00:11:15.320
The Delta Platoon will head for point Echo.

00:11:15.320 --> 00:11:17.150
Time to repay our debts!

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:19.530
All Delta Platoon units on launch catapults.

00:11:20.280 --> 00:11:24.750
Delta 1 to Delta 5. This is your first space battle.

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:26.540
A dogfight in space is a different beast.

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:28.760
Also, pay attention not to run out of propellant.

00:11:28.760 --> 00:11:30.480
Roger.

00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:31.970
Let's do this, Mirage.

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:34.210
Show the Grim Reaper what we're made of.

00:11:35.430 --> 00:11:36.710
You can count on me.

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:45.590
Music is love!

00:11:45.590 --> 00:11:47.100
Music is hope!

00:11:47.100 --> 00:11:48.600
Music is life!

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:50.100
Music is energy!

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:52.990
Lend an ear to the songs of a goddess!

00:11:52.990 --> 00:11:55.860
Super Dimension Venus, Walkure!

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:58.660
<i>Kiss, kiss, feel love</i>

00:11:58.910 --> 00:12:01.570
<i>Kiss, kiss, feel love</i>

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:08.020
<i>You can't reach the future if you never take off</i>

00:12:08.020 --> 00:12:13.420
<i>Take me along to the end of space as you fly away</i>

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:14.880
Delta Platoon, engage!

00:12:13.420 --> 00:12:17.380
<i>When the music of mercy rings aloud</i>

00:12:17.380 --> 00:12:24.660
<i>I hope you're going to pick me</i>

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:25.010
A song...

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:26.660
<i>Kiss, kiss, feel love</i>

00:12:25.010 --> 00:12:27.320
Gotcha!

00:12:27.230 --> 00:12:32.020
<i>Can you hear the song of life?</i>

00:12:30.730 --> 00:12:32.020
One down!

00:12:32.020 --> 00:12:38.770
<i>I'm sure it means the beginning is tomorrow</i>

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:44.780
<i>With love in our hearts, we spread this melody</i>

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:49.910
<i>As our blue star guides me to you</i>

00:12:47.480 --> 00:12:49.320
Windamereans incoming from above!

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:55.630
<i>I'm still here, singing about our dream</i>

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:52.620
Here they come.

00:12:53.800 --> 00:12:55.080
White Knight.

00:12:55.630 --> 00:13:01.220
<i>Come, it's time to spread our wings together</i>

00:12:55.890 --> 00:12:57.330
Grim Reaper.

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:03.300
<i>The solitude of tomorrow</i>

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:06.470
<i>must stay my secret</i>

00:13:06.470 --> 00:13:09.470
<i>As I take your hand</i>

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:15.810
<i>and fall with you into the abyss</i>

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:10.970
Delta 5!

00:13:20.540 --> 00:13:22.990
Messer... and the White Knight?!

00:13:23.290 --> 00:13:28.870
<i>I break you free of the darkness in your eyes</i>

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:30.370
Time to ride the wind.

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:34.240
<i>We must change our hearts and fly away</i>

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:36.160
Incredible. They're using the asteroids to jump around.

00:13:34.240 --> 00:13:38.500
<i>The sight so dreadful when I was alone</i>

00:13:36.980 --> 00:13:38.540
Let's go!

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:45.720
<i>seems lovely now that you're with me</i>

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:44.900
I can't catch up!

00:13:44.900 --> 00:13:47.240
Delta 5, behind you, from above!

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:47.930
<i>Kiss, kiss, feel love</i>

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:52.800
<i>You're my love and mine only</i>

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:49.910
He dodged it!

00:13:49.910 --> 00:13:50.640
How?!

00:13:53.420 --> 00:13:59.560
<i>If it's some strength that we need, perhaps I can help</i>

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:05.610
<i>Just take my hand and let's play our symphony</i>

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:01.400
He's dancing...

00:14:01.400 --> 00:14:02.650
with the wind!

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:10.680
<i>Look as shooting stars rain on our blue star</i>

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:16.120
<i>Please don't tell me we can't see each other again</i>

00:14:16.430 --> 00:14:24.760
<i>Ah, someone is fighting out there</i>

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:17.750
The song!

00:14:22.590 --> 00:14:24.760
My rune... My rune!

00:14:27.260 --> 00:14:29.150
Such a nuisance!

00:14:29.150 --> 00:14:31.180
Let's finish this, Theo, Xao!

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:32.690
Show them the wrath

00:14:32.690 --> 00:14:34.060
of the true wind!

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:41.810
<i>Listen! Hear the miracle of the world</i>

00:14:38.850 --> 00:14:40.060
They got past us!

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:41.010
Alpha, Beta Platoons!

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:41.810
You've got incoming!

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:43.700
This is Alpha Leader! I copy!

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:46.570
<i>The wind won't blow it out, just makes it burn brighter</i>

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:52.550
<i>Don't forget it! I never could</i>

00:14:52.550 --> 00:15:02.750
<i>Once more, many more Walkure attacks</i>

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:02.000
Shoot!

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:03.000
Freyja!

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:08.800
<i>Power overwhelming echoes in this rhapsody</i>

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:13.870
<i>As the whole world is lit by our blue star</i>

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:12.960
Go to hell!

00:15:13.870 --> 00:15:19.270
<i>Please don't make me say farewell ever again</i>

00:15:17.650 --> 00:15:19.270
The T-point barrier?

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:28.440
<i>Ah, someone is fighting out there</i>

00:15:33.400 --> 00:15:35.660
Found you, traitor!

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:37.370
Traitor?

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:40.750
Hayate!

00:15:46.980 --> 00:15:48.350
Hayate!

00:15:48.350 --> 00:15:49.590
I can't fall be—

00:15:54.670 --> 00:15:58.030
Leutnant Uroh! You've yet to take down an enemy in combat, correct?

00:15:58.760 --> 00:15:59.810
Hauptmann Herman?

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:03.060
I'll corner them for you. Shoot them down.

00:16:03.430 --> 00:16:05.770
Da. May my rune guide me!

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:11.000
I lost him...

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:12.660
Mayday! Mayday!

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:13.160
Mirage?!

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:26.750
Playing me for a fool?!

00:16:28.180 --> 00:16:29.460
I'll finish you!

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:32.760
I'm too far!

00:16:33.380 --> 00:16:34.590
Out of propellant?

00:16:42.690 --> 00:16:44.190
Mirage!

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:01.830
Hayate...

00:17:03.030 --> 00:17:05.290
Star Master to all Knights.

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:07.150
That will suffice.

00:17:07.150 --> 00:17:08.750
All units return to the Branch.

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:11.300
Not yet. We'll annihilate them all.

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:15.030
His Highness wishes for no unnecessary sacrifices.

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:16.970
Do you intend on opposing his will?

00:17:47.570 --> 00:17:49.840
How is he?

00:17:49.840 --> 00:17:51.580
Hard to tell.

00:17:51.580 --> 00:17:53.990
He's got a knack for piloting.

00:17:54.540 --> 00:17:55.250
But...

00:17:56.240 --> 00:17:58.680
Soldiering... I'm not so sure.

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:00.970
Hayate did that?

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:02.470
Yeah.

00:18:05.700 --> 00:18:07.730
Get going.

00:18:08.040 --> 00:18:12.190
We don't need someone who 
lets inane words get to her.

00:18:12.900 --> 00:18:15.400
<i>Found you, traitor!</i>

00:18:17.110 --> 00:18:17.900
Mikumo!

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:23.580
Fre-Fre has to fight against people from her home!

00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:26.040
And?

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:31.180
Your voice won't echo across the galaxy like this.

00:18:32.440 --> 00:18:34.630
We're Walkure.

00:18:34.910 --> 00:18:38.060
Why do you stand on stage?

00:18:38.060 --> 00:18:39.790
For what purpose?

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:42.260
What feelings do you put into your singing?

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:45.660
Think that through once more.

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:56.520
Thanks. You saved me.

00:19:00.340 --> 00:19:05.620
The first time I killed someone 
was a year after I joined Spacy.

00:19:08.020 --> 00:19:13.700
We were fighting rebels who'd 
taken over an Island-class ship.

00:19:13.700 --> 00:19:16.540
I thought I was fully prepared,

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:20.310
but I don't think I'll ever get over it.

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:24.980
I just learned how to pretend that it didn't affect me.

00:19:26.910 --> 00:19:30.840
I'm sure everyone deals with the 
same issue. They just don't let it show.

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:34.730
The captain and First Lt. Messer...

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:35.930
Second Lt. Chuck too.

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:40.860
Every kill is a new burden.

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:49.820
I think it's our cross to bear as soldiers.

00:19:49.820 --> 00:19:58.040
And if carrying that burden means we protected someone's happiness,

00:19:58.040 --> 00:20:01.500
then I'd say it was worth the price.

00:20:05.270 --> 00:20:06.500
Thank you...

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:13.420
Instructor.

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:22.040
I knew the time would come eventually.

00:20:22.040 --> 00:20:25.570
And you, the captain, and Chuck... even Messer,

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:29.020
everyone's fighting with their lives on the line.

00:20:29.020 --> 00:20:33.680
The girls of Walkure suppress the Var with their songs.

00:20:33.680 --> 00:20:36.280
At first I couldn't believe it,

00:20:36.280 --> 00:20:38.860
but they, too, are risking their lives for this.

00:20:42.870 --> 00:20:45.840
I won't back down.

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:49.350
Same here.

00:20:50.660 --> 00:20:52.140
What was that?

00:20:52.140 --> 00:20:53.980
I didn't say anything.

00:20:54.550 --> 00:21:00.740
Risking my life... For what purpose? What feelings?

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:08.200
Scarfell, Old Town of Carlisle

00:21:12.740 --> 00:21:16.000
Where are we going, brother?

00:21:31.410 --> 00:21:33.730
Don't avert your eyes.

00:21:33.730 --> 00:21:37.950
Look at our scar.

00:21:37.950 --> 00:21:39.930
Look at the brand of our shame.

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:49.870
Mission 06: Decision Overload

00:21:50.230 --> 00:21:51.710
Are you ready now?

00:22:02.630 --> 00:22:09.890
<i>I heard a rumor saying the world's gonna end someday</i>

00:22:09.890 --> 00:22:15.400
<i>Just kidding, that's so obvious</i>

00:22:17.070 --> 00:22:20.740
<i>I remember looking up at the sky</i>

00:22:20.740 --> 00:22:24.450
<i>and feeling like I was in the future</i>

00:22:24.450 --> 00:22:30.050
<i>I felt completely in sync with your wind</i>

00:22:32.010 --> 00:22:39.050
<i>I finally found a place where I could be a girl</i>

00:22:39.050 --> 00:22:46.550
<i>so I've got no choice but to do it. I can't stop now!</i>

00:22:46.550 --> 00:22:48.140
You better be ready!

00:22:48.140 --> 00:22:51.730
<i>If my rune shines with a flash</i>

00:22:51.730 --> 00:22:55.480
<i>(wow wow wowow)</i>

00:22:55.480 --> 00:22:58.970
<i>I fall in love</i>

00:22:58.970 --> 00:23:02.440
<i>(wow wow wowow)</i>

00:23:02.830 --> 00:23:07.990
<i>Lalali lalala it's your fault</i>

00:23:10.170 --> 00:23:15.780
<i>Lalala I feel peerless when my rune flashes{fuck this shit}</i>

00:23:20.900 --> 00:23:23.750
We've got new orders from Lady M.

00:23:23.920 --> 00:23:31.430
We need to investigate the planets occupied by 
Windermere and find out what they're doing there.

00:23:32.030 --> 00:23:36.260
Our mission is to infiltrate the occupied planet Voldor.

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:39.850
Next time: Behind Enemy Lines

00:23:39.850 --> 00:23:39.900
Mikumo is such a bitch. Someone give me Sheryl back please.
